= \ & \frac{2\sin{\frac{(\beta\cdot E)\hbar}{2}}}{\beta\cdot E}\big(\W^{K_S}_\beta+\sum_{T\in \RT_\beta,\atop t^{-1}(0)\neq \emptyset} \Cont_{T}\big).
